abstract: >
  An institutional-grade, multi-asset algorithmic trading system designed for MetaTrader 5.
  It integrates Perry Kaufman's Trading Systems & Methods (Efficiency Ratio and KAMA dynamic
  smoothing), Elder's Triple Screen framework, Depth of Market (DOM) order flow detection,
  and real-time ONNX Neural Network inference across a 30-asset premier global portfolio.

